	"You made an enemy of an adventurer. Roll a {@dice d6} ": "你與一位冒險者結仇。擲一次{@dice d6} ",
	"You spent time working in a job related to your background. Start the game with an extra {@dice 2d6} ": "你曾從事與背景相關的工作。遊戲開始時，額外獲得{@dice 2d6} ",
	"You nearly died. You have nasty scars on your body, and you are missing an ear, {@dice 1d3} ": "你曾險些喪命，身上留下可怕的疤痕，且失去一隻耳朵、{@dice 1d3} ",
	" fingers, or {@dice 1d4} ": "根手指，或{@dice 1d4} ",
	" toes.": "根腳趾。",
	"You found some treasure on your adventure. You have {@dice 2d6} ": "你在冒險中發現一些財寶。分到的財物如今還剩{@dice 2d6} ",
	" gp left from your share of it.": " gp。",
	"You found a considerable amount of treasure on your adventure. You have {@dice 1d20 + 50} ": "你在冒險中發現大量財寶。分到的財物如今還剩{@dice 1d20 + 50} ",
	"You were charmed or frightened by a spell.": "你曾被法術魅惑或恐慌。",
	"You turned invisible for a time.": "你曾有一段時間處於隱形狀態。",
	"Your fortune was read by a diviner. Roll twice on the Life Events table, but don't apply the results. Instead, the DM picks one event as a portent of your future (which might or might not come true).": "一位占卜師曾替你算命。擲骰查閱人生事件表兩次，但不套用結果；改由 DM 選擇其中一件事，作為你未來的預兆（不一定會成真）。",
	"You found a {@item riding horse}.": "你找到一匹{@item riding horse||乘用馬}。",
	"You found some money. You have {@dice 1d20} ": "你撿到一些錢。在正常起始資金之外，額外獲得{@dice 1d20} ",
	" gp in addition to your regular starting funds.": " gp。",
	"You found something interesting. You gain one additional trinket ": "你找到有趣的東西，額外獲得一件小飾品：",
	"A distant relative left you a stipend that enables you to live at the comfortable lifestyle for {@dice 1d20} ": "一位遠親留給你一筆生活費，讓你能維持舒適生活方式{@dice 1d20} ",
	" years. If you choose to live at a higher lifestyle, you reduce the price of the lifestyle by 2 gp during that time period.": "年。若選擇更高水準的生活方式，在此期間其生活費用減少 2 gp。",
	"You were caught and convicted. You spent time in jail, chained to an oar, or performing hard labor. You served a sentence of {@dice 1d4} years ": "你遭逮捕並定罪，曾入獄、被鎖在船槳旁或服苦役。你服刑{@dice 1d4}年 ",
	" or succeeded in escaping after that much time.": "，或在經過這麼長的時間後成功逃脫。",
	"You were ensorcelled by a fey and enslaved for {@dice 1d6} ": "你曾被妖精以魔法控制並奴役{@dice 1d6} ",
	" years before you escaped.": "年，之後才逃脫。",
	"A devil tempted you. Make a DC 10 Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, your alignment shifts one step toward evil (if it's not evil already), and you start the game with an additional {@dice 1d20 + 50} ": "一個魔鬼曾誘惑你。進行一次 DC 10 感知豁免；失敗時，若你並非邪惡陣營，陣營便朝邪惡移動一步，且遊戲開始時額外獲得{@dice 1d20 + 50} ",
	"You were briefly possessed. Roll a {@dice d6} to determine what type of creature possessed you: 1, celestial; 2, devil; 3, demon; 4, fey; 5, elemental; 6, undead": "你曾短暫遭到附身。擲一次{@dice d6}決定附身的生物種類：1，天界；2，魔鬼；3，惡魔；4，妖精；5，元素；6，不死生物",
	"A celestial or a fiend visited you in your dreams to give a warning of dangers to come.": "一個天界生物或邪魔在夢中造訪你，警告即將到來的危險。",
	"You briefly visited the Feywild or the Shadowfell": "你曾短暫造訪妖精荒野或墮影冥界",
	"A family member or a close friend died. Roll on the {@table Supplemental Tables; Cause of Death|XGE|Cause of Death} supplemental table to find out how.": "一位家人或摯友去世。擲骰查閱補充表中的{@table Supplemental Tables; Cause of Death|XGE|死因}表，決定死因。",
	"You were imprisoned for a crime you didn't commit and spent {@dice 1d6} ": "你因未曾犯下的罪行入獄，度過{@dice 1d6} ",
	" years at hard labor, in jail, or shackled to an oar in a slave galley.": "年的苦役、牢獄生活，或被鎖在奴隸划槳船的船槳旁。",
	"A romantic relationship ended. Roll a {@dice d6} ": "一段戀情結束了。擲一次{@dice d6} ",
	"A current or prospective romantic partner of yours died. Roll on the {@table Supplemental Tables; Cause of Death|XGE|Cause of Death} supplemental table to find out how. If the result is murder, roll a {@dice d12}. On a 1, you were responsible, whether directly or indirectly.": "你當時的戀人或可能發展成戀人的對象去世。擲骰查閱補充表中的{@table Supplemental Tables; Cause of Death|XGE|死因}表。若結果為謀殺，擲一次{@dice d12}；若為 1，你對此負有直接或間接的責任。",
	"You were turned into a toad and remained in that form for {@dice 1d4} ": "你曾被變成蟾蜍，維持此形態{@dice 1d4} ",
	" weeks.": "週。",
	"You were petrified and remained a stone statue for a time until someone freed you.": "你曾被石化，維持石像形態一段時間，直到有人解救你。",
	"You were enslaved by a hag, a satyr, or some other being and lived in that creature's thrall for {@dice 1d6} ": "你曾遭鬼婆、薩堤爾或其他生物奴役，在其掌控下生活了{@dice 1d6} ",
	"You were enslaved by a hag, a satyr, or some other being and lived in that creature’s thrall for {@dice 1d6} years.": "你曾遭鬼婆、薩堤爾或其他生物奴役，在其掌控下生活了{@dice 1d6}年。",
	" years.": "年。",
	"A dragon held you as a prisoner for {@dice 1d4} ": "一條龍曾囚禁你{@dice 1d4} ",
	" months until adventurers killed it.": "個月，直到冒險者殺死牠。",
	"You went insane for {@dice 1d6} ": "你曾瘋狂了{@dice 1d6} ",
	" years and recently regained your sanity. A tic or some other bit of odd behavior might linger.": "年，最近才恢復神智；可能仍留有抽搐或其他古怪習慣。",
	"You met a demigod, an archdevil, an archfey, a demon lord, or a titan, ": "你曾遇見半神、大魔鬼、至高妖精、惡魔領主或泰坦，",
